    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/1e1bbd786a112d6a2ea24d48d5404acd.avif?t=1718901278\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/5120c464628ea254d723b93b9d6df49a.poster.avif?t=1718901278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/5120c464628ea254d723b93b9d6df49a.webm?t=1718901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/5120c464628ea254d723b93b9d6df49a.mp4?t=1718901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defend the your base from successives waves to win.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/34eea3083c944dbff0f1a811e3c3dafa.avif?t=1718901278\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/d35fda97f9f55f5224baaf4927849422.poster.avif?t=1718901278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/d35fda97f9f55f5224baaf4927849422.webm?t=1718901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/d35fda97f9f55f5224baaf4927849422.mp4?t=1718901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each run has randomized buffs and unit that you can unlock.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/ecd70b35dd224ce26a201637f137c7de.avif?t=1718901278\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/7ecb02ec3b5bc25746e21b7b7663fb87.poster.avif?t=1718901278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/7ecb02ec3b5bc25746e21b7b7663fb87.webm?t=1718901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/7ecb02ec3b5bc25746e21b7b7663fb87.mp4?t=1718901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fair and Square is a classic fast paced real time strategy game where you build your base and you control every workers and production buildings closely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/9f4f15b89c2ee56df28bf830b1e9f590.avif?t=1718901278\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/225107ba38e58a858028f8450a1698bc.poster.avif?t=1718901278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/225107ba38e58a858028f8450a1698bc.webm?t=1718901278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546350/extras/225107ba38e58a858028f8450a1698bc.mp4?t=1718901278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>100 Hz rts engine and smooth unit control allow you to get the most out of every unit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Classic RTS controls<br></li><li> Solo or two players coop mode<br></li><li> Roguelike elements<br></li><li> 70 unique runic empowerments</li></ul>",
